WEBVTT

00:01:44.320 --> 00:01:48.760
<i>All will be made clear, in the course of nature.</i>

00:01:50.630 --> 00:01:51.710
<i>Eve...</i>

00:01:55.110 --> 00:01:55.710
Eve.

00:02:02.250 --> 00:02:03.360
Where am I?

00:02:15.350 --> 00:02:16.930
You're finally awake.

00:02:23.740 --> 00:02:25.620
You sleep so soundly, for livestock.

00:02:25.620 --> 00:02:27.860
L-Livestock?!

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:32.460
Wh-Who are you?

00:02:32.940 --> 00:02:35.390
And... where am I?

00:02:38.420 --> 00:02:39.550
Why did you bring me—

00:02:41.940 --> 00:02:43.550
Shut up!

00:02:43.550 --> 00:02:46.560
Quit your squealing, you sow!

00:02:49.060 --> 00:02:52.460
Now, now. After being brought here so suddenly,

00:02:52.460 --> 00:02:54.570
of course she's gonna be confused.

00:02:55.090 --> 00:02:56.940
Right, masochistic kitten?

00:02:57.930 --> 00:03:02.970
Hey... Do you like...

00:03:03.670 --> 00:03:04.780
pain?

00:03:06.700 --> 00:03:08.560
Hey, now, Azusa-kun.

00:03:08.560 --> 00:03:10.850
That's inappropriate to ask 
a person you just met.

00:03:10.850 --> 00:03:12.790
You have to introduce yourself first.

00:03:13.800 --> 00:03:16.000
So let's start over.

00:03:17.270 --> 00:03:21.510
I'm Kou Mukami. Nice to 
meet you, masochistic kitten.

00:03:22.120 --> 00:03:24.220
I'm Yuma Mukami.

00:03:24.670 --> 00:03:26.050
Mukami?

00:03:26.050 --> 00:03:29.730
We're all brothers. And this is...

00:03:30.700 --> 00:03:32.350
Azusa.

00:03:36.840 --> 00:03:37.790
I'm Ruki.

00:03:38.360 --> 00:03:42.060
This is the mansion we all live in.

00:03:42.060 --> 00:03:45.320
You're going to live here with
us too, masochistic kitten.

00:03:45.320 --> 00:03:47.040
What? Live here?

00:03:48.380 --> 00:03:49.880
I can't do that!

00:03:49.880 --> 00:03:51.370
I'm going back!

00:03:52.650 --> 00:03:53.620
Going back?

00:03:57.960 --> 00:04:00.550
You want to go back to the Sakamaki mansion?

00:04:02.100 --> 00:04:07.230
You were treated as a plaything by the
vampires at that mansion, were you not?

00:04:11.860 --> 00:04:14.080
So by being kept as their pet,

00:04:14.080 --> 00:04:18.140
even your mind degraded
to the level of livestock?

00:04:18.140 --> 00:04:19.730
Th-That's not...

00:04:21.380 --> 00:04:25.820
B-But you're all vampires too, aren't you?

00:04:26.460 --> 00:04:29.580
So it'd be the same if I stayed here!

00:04:30.440 --> 00:04:33.080
I don't appreciate you comparing us to them.

00:04:34.390 --> 00:04:37.550
Unlike them, we at least have some sense.

00:04:39.000 --> 00:04:42.590
There's no way I can believe that.

00:04:45.090 --> 00:04:48.050
Man, how annoying!

00:04:48.970 --> 00:04:53.350
We really don't care if you're convinced or not!

00:04:54.620 --> 00:04:58.810
He's right. Our plan requires your...

00:04:59.440 --> 00:05:02.260
Eve's... blood.

00:05:03.920 --> 00:05:05.320
Eve's blood?

00:05:07.910 --> 00:05:08.910
<i>Eve.</i>

00:05:09.360 --> 00:05:13.530
Eve is... me?

00:05:14.700 --> 00:05:16.000
How can that be?

00:05:16.600 --> 00:05:22.300
You are... definitely... Eve.

00:05:22.550 --> 00:05:25.380
N-No! I'm not Eve!

00:05:24.640 --> 00:05:26.800
Quit whining over everything!

00:05:27.060 --> 00:05:29.600
All you need to do is shut up and obey us.

00:05:42.350 --> 00:05:45.680
As the one who possesses the blood of Eve,

00:05:46.790 --> 00:05:50.490
you should be able to find him without error.

00:05:53.260 --> 00:05:54.400
You'll find Adam.

00:05:56.200 --> 00:05:57.250
Adam?

00:06:01.150 --> 00:06:05.010
From now on, you'll be living here with us.

00:06:05.710 --> 00:06:08.030
Your opinion doesn't matter.

00:06:08.030 --> 00:06:12.640
As long as you're Eve, 
you're going to obey our rules.

00:06:13.480 --> 00:06:15.840
Take some time in here to clear your mind.

00:06:37.400 --> 00:06:41.710
Damn... I can't find Pancake anywhere.

00:06:42.030 --> 00:06:46.620
Seriously, where did Little Bitch run off to?

00:06:48.190 --> 00:06:50.600
I'm so thirsty...

00:06:52.410 --> 00:06:54.100
Any idea, Subaru-kun?

00:06:54.460 --> 00:06:56.470
How would I know?

00:06:59.040 --> 00:07:03.770
How dare she act on her own? 
She's nothing but prey.

00:07:03.770 --> 00:07:05.490
Where did she go?

00:07:06.180 --> 00:07:07.740
Just leave her be.

00:07:08.740 --> 00:07:11.050
She'll come back eventually.

00:07:17.170 --> 00:07:19.480
I hope you're right.

00:08:05.430 --> 00:08:06.670
<i>Isn't there...</i>

00:08:09.600 --> 00:08:11.170
<i>someplace where I can get out?</i>

00:08:50.090 --> 00:08:51.960
Trying to escape, I see.

00:08:52.630 --> 00:08:55.300
You really are ill-behaved livestock.

00:08:56.570 --> 00:08:58.090
You're sleeping here tonight.

00:09:01.400 --> 00:09:03.530
If you want to run, I won't stop you,

00:09:03.530 --> 00:09:06.810
but only punishment awaits you if you do.

00:09:07.580 --> 00:09:09.190
Keep that in mind.

00:09:13.450 --> 00:09:17.780
Are you looking at me like that
hoping to provoke sympathy?

00:09:17.780 --> 00:09:19.600
I-I'm not—

00:09:19.950 --> 00:09:23.760
Unfortunately, that kind of thing
doesn't work on vampires.

00:09:39.470 --> 00:09:40.720
I'm sorry!

00:09:47.910 --> 00:09:49.610
Eve, huh?

00:09:54.650 --> 00:09:58.160
To think that the one we were 
searching for, a being like no other,

00:09:58.160 --> 00:10:00.810
turned out to be a mediocre 
woman such as yourself.

00:10:05.010 --> 00:10:08.080
But this must be done for our cause.

00:10:24.680 --> 00:10:26.230
I see...

00:10:26.760 --> 00:10:29.290
So this is the blood of Eve...

00:10:31.980 --> 00:10:33.430
Stop!

00:11:07.930 --> 00:11:14.900
As long as he wishes it, we will 
continue to desire your blood.

00:12:20.330 --> 00:12:22.010
If you want to run, then run.

00:12:23.000 --> 00:12:25.430
Only punishment awaits you if you do.

00:12:25.970 --> 00:12:28.600
Your blood is the beginning of everything...

00:12:29.210 --> 00:12:33.670
Eve, if you are Eve, you will surely guide us.

00:12:35.130 --> 00:12:38.770
I'll wash off all traces of filth on you, 
and engrave myself there.
